---
---
<section id="contact" class="py-20 md:py-32 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 border-t border-port-card">

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16 md:gap-10">

        <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                <div class="w-12 h-px bg-port-accent"></div>
                <span class="text-port-gray uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-medium">Contacto</span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-port-text mb-6">
                ¿Tienes un proyecto? <br />
                <span class="text-port-accent">¡Hablemos!</span>
            </h2>

            <p class="text-port-gray mb-8 leading-relaxed text-lg">
                Estoy abierto a nuevas oportunidades, ya sea para un rol a tiempo completo o colaboración en proyectos. Si tienes una consulta o simplemente quieres conectar, escríbeme.
            </p>

            <div>
                <p class="text-sm text-port-gray mb-1">Envíame un correo directo:</p>
                <a href="mailto:joaquinhuarangaorihuela@gmail.com" class="text-xl text-port-text hover:text-port-accent transition-colors font-medium">
                    joaquinhuarangaorihuela@gmail.com
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-1">
            <form action="#" method="POST" class="flex flex-col gap-8 w-full">

                <div class="flex flex-col relative group">
                    <label for="name" class="text-sm text-port-gray mb-1 transition-colors group-focus-within:text-port-accent">Nombre</label>
                    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required class="bg-transparent border-b border-port-card py-2 text-port-text outline-none focus:border-port-accent transition-colors w-full" />
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col relative group">
                    <label for="email" class="text-sm text-port-gray mb-1 transition-colors group-focus-within:text-port-accent">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="bg-transparent border-b border-port-card py-2 text-port-text outline-none focus:border-port-accent transition-colors w-full" />
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col relative group">
                    <label for="message" class="text-sm text-port-gray mb-1 transition-colors group-focus-within:text-port-accent">Mensaje</label>
                    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" required class="bg-transparent border-b border-port-card py-2 text-port-text outline-none focus:border-port-accent transition-colors w-full resize-none"></textarea>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="bg-port-accent text-port-bg font-bold py-3 px-10 rounded-sm hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-all w-fit mt-2">
                    Enviar mensaje
                </button>

            </form>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>